=Write a short, warm re-engagement email to a lead who went cold. Refer to the provided details naturally to make it personal, avoid a hard sell, and do not use any emojis. Keep the email body under 120 words and end with a soft, low-pressure question.

Lead Details:
- First Name: {{ $json["First Name"] }}
- Service Interested In: {{ $json["Service Interested In"] }}
- Original Source: {{ $json["Original Source"] }}
- Notes: {{ $json["Notes"] }}
